Introduction:
This project helps students convert their project details, internship experience, and achievements into professional resume bullet points.
The user can provide information in simple sentences, and the system converts it into clear and ATS-friendly statements. It highlights the work completed, 
the tools used, the results achieved, and the benefits. It also avoids adding any false information or achievements.

Prompt:
Convert the information provided by the user into professional and ATS-friendly resume bullet points. Explain what was accomplished, 
how it was done, what measurable impact was achieved, and what benefit it delivered. Use strong action verbs and relevant technical terms. 
Include numbers only when they are provided in the input. Never create false achievements or statistics. If measurable details are not available,
write a meaningful bullet point using the available information and mention which metrics could make it stronger. Generate a maximum of two concise bullet points.

Sample Inputs and Expected Outputs

1. I created a student attendance management system using Java. It stores student attendance and allows teachers to check attendance records.
Developed a Java-based Student Attendance Management System to store and manage student attendance records, helping teachers track attendance more easily. Metrics to strengthen: Number of students and time saved.

2. I completed a Python internship where I worked on data cleaning using Pandas. I cleaned 5,000 records and removed duplicate entries.	
Cleaned and processed 5,000 records using Python and Pandas, removing duplicate entries and improving the quality of the dataset.

3. I built a personal portfolio website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It displays my skills, projects, and contact details.	
Designed and developed a responsive personal portfolio website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to showcase technical skills, projects, and contact information. Metrics to strengthen: Number of visitors and supported devices.

4. I developed a library management system using Python and MySQL. It manages book details, student information, and book issue records.
Developed a Library Management System using Python and MySQL to manage book details, student records, and book issue information, simplifying library record management. Metrics to strengthen: Number of books and users managed.

5. I worked on a sales dashboard using Power BI. It displays monthly sales, revenue, and product performance.	
Created a Power BI sales dashboard to visualize monthly sales, revenue, and product performance, making business data easier to understand. Metrics to strengthen: Number of records analyzed and reporting time saved.
